{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":589669,"name":"Akkulappagari Niharika","username":"NiharikaReddy","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/community.n8n.io/niharikareddy/{size}/185643_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-23T04:47:44.570Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey everyone!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI’m Niharika, an \u003cstrong\u003eAI Automation Engineer and an n8n enthusiast\u003c/strong\u003e. I’ve been working extensively with n8n to build automations that connect APIs, databases, AI models, CRMs, WhatsApp, LinkedIn and other platforms together.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI’m currently open to \u003cstrong\u003efreelance projects, contract work, or interesting automation collaborations\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSome of the things I’ve been building recently:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twemoji/small_blue_diamond.png?v=15\" title=\":small_blue_diamond:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":small_blue_diamond:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eLinkedIn Automation\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nLead generation, Sales Navigator workflows, profile data processing, enrichment, filtering, deduplication and database updates.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twemoji/small_blue_diamond.png?v=15\" title=\":small_blue_diamond:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":small_blue_diamond:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eLinkedIn \u0026amp; Instagram Hashtag Automation\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nOne area I’ve been particularly working on is \u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"hashtag-raw\"\u003e#hashtag-based\u003c/span\u003e content discovery\u003c/strong\u003e. I’ve built workflows around searching and processing hashtag/content data from LinkedIn and Instagram, structuring the results and making them usable for \u003cstrong\u003esocial walls and website displays\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twemoji/small_blue_diamond.png?v=15\" title=\":small_blue_diamond:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":small_blue_diamond:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eAI + n8n Automations\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nWorkflows using OpenAI, Claude and Gemini for content generation, classification, summarization, data processing and intelligent routing.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twemoji/small_blue_diamond.png?v=15\" title=\":small_blue_diamond:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":small_blue_diamond:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eAI Voice + WhatsApp\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nBuilt event confirmation systems using AI voice agents, WhatsApp follow-ups and automated FAQ handling.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twemoji/small_blue_diamond.png?v=15\" title=\":small_blue_diamond:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":small_blue_diamond:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eAPI \u0026amp; Database Integrations\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nI work quite a lot with REST APIs, webhooks, authentication, pagination, JavaScript/Python code nodes and SQL databases.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat I really enjoy about n8n is that it lets me go beyond simple automation. A lot of my work involves figuring out \u003cstrong\u003ewhy an API isn’t behaving as expected, handling messy data, debugging webhooks, writing custom logic, and making the workflow reliable enough to actually run in production.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI’m always interested in connecting with people who are building something with n8n — whether you need help \u003cstrong\u003ebuilding a workflow, debugging an existing one, or figuring out how to automate a process.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFeel free to DM me here or reach out:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEmail:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003ca href=\"mailto:niharikareddy16012004@gmail.com\"\u003eniharikareddy16012004@gmail.com\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLinkedIn:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003ca href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/niharikareddy16/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003ehttps://www.linkedin.com/in/niharikareddy16/\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e— Niharika\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":1,"updated_at":"2026-09-23T04:47:44.570Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":3,"reads":20,"readers_count":19,"score":8.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":315837,"topic_slug":"available-for-freelance-n8n-developer-ai-automation-specialist","display_username":"Akkulappagari Niharika","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/niharikareddy16/","internal":false,"reflection":false,"clicks":2}],"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":190152,"hidden":false,"trust_level":1,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"mentioned_users":[],"post_url":"/t/available-for-freelance-n8n-developer-ai-automation-specialist/315837/1","locale":null,"is_localized":false,"reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false}],"stream":[589669]},"timeline_lookup":[[1,1]],"suggested_topics":[],"tags":[],"tags_descriptions":{},"fancy_title":"Available for Freelance: n8n Developer \u0026amp; AI Automation Specialist","fancy_titl